{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他还憋着气，但想起曾经被当作自己人，短暂高兴了一会儿，随后又心酸，开始怀疑离开后是否真的会更好。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"憋闷、短暂欣喜、酸楚、犹疑\",\n      \"missed\": \"右上角“离开后才发现心里空了”不够醒目。和弦像重锤、节奏忽强忽弱，以及出去走走、聊别的只是暂时避开问题、心事仍无答案等内容，都需要读小字才能理解。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他仍然没有完全消气，回想起曾经被接纳的时刻而短暂开心，但很快又感到酸楚，无法确定离开是不是更好的选择。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"憋闷、欣喜、心酸、失落、不确定\",\n      \"missed\": \"主要故事仍然能抓到，但“出去走走、聊点别的”背后的暂时逃避，以及多声絮语、调性不稳、昂扬渐渐退潮等情绪和音乐之间的对应关系，需要逐句阅读。右上角的小标题也容易漏掉。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他想起曾经被当作自己人时的温暖，短暂高兴后又陷入心酸：过去回不去了，离开是否就意味着更好的生活，他自己也没有答案。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"憋闷、短暂欣喜、怀旧、温柔、酸楚、失落\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的“66–79焦躁急切，80–91转柔和轻盈”，以及故乡夏日麦浪、微风、从前亲近而无需防备的时刻，都在较小的说明文字里。尤其“温柔得让人心颤，因它离眼前太远”这一层情绪，需要逐句读才能抓到。新增内容也让上方文字区域明显变密。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"两条大标题都很醒目，但篇幅较长，第一眼需要在上下两个重点之间切换。真正把人物处境、短暂轻松和后续心酸连接起来的解释藏在较小的文字里；第三张新增的麦浪、微风和旧日亲近感也没有获得足够的视觉突出。下半部分金色音符轨迹能传达流动和起伏，却不能直接呈现人物回忆中的温暖画面。整体故事是连贯的，但连接情绪与具体画面的关键内容不容易一眼扫到。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "aceac5ba-4032-41e3-922e-38baa8509fde", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T003842306105Z", "elapsed_seconds": 62.984, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:39:45.279882+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "222f553953abbea985b9c64a4f71d046fde6fbf2e809be4fc677d1f27463f25f", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T003842306105Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "c0696986eb06a177b5a685e4bde85a551f47da81b53f672358d093b9f617bbb6"}}}
